(14) “officer” means a person commissioned, gazetted or in pay as an officer of the Force, but does not include a junior commissioned officer;
(15) “prescribed” means prescribed by rules;
(16) “regulations” means regulations made under this Act;
(17) “rules” means rules made under this Act; and
(18) “unit” means a unit of the Force.
